  0013-info-panel-credits-aligned-left-Copyleft-lines.patch
  0014-icons-standard-margin-smooth-scaling-and-clip-shadow.patch
  0015-wmspec-a-dock-that-takes-no-input-is-not-focusable.patch
  0016-dock-a-docked-dockapp-starts-with-Window-Maker.patch
  0017-motif-follow-MOTIF_WM_HINTS-changed-after-the-window-is-mapped.patch
